Z||000000||bHooper||10-19-2001||11:30 AM||||Hey everyone, I just wanted to let you know that it appears my period of unemployment may now be over.  If I pass the drug test (which shouldn't be a problem), I will be starting to work for Swisher International on November 5th. <P>Swisher the cigar company, not the urinal cake company!  <P>Ironic, that my unemployment runs out this week, and I start my new job in two!<P>Me happy!  The only two drawbacks of the job are: 1) They provide a Minivan  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> and 2) I have to wear a necktie everyday.<P>But other than that it's great!<P><P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="red"><B>Red</B></FONT></FONT> 86 GT 5 speed<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><B>Black</B></FONT> <u>86 SE Automatic</u>||||reg||10
