Z||000011||Fformula88||10-19-2001||02:46 PM||||Congrats on the new job!  Its been a long time comin for ya!<P>Do ya know what kind of minivan?  I know some will disagree, but they aren't all bad.  I learned to drive on minivans and have a soft spot for them.  It might have been the particular van though... my moms Pontiac Trans Sport.  Its too bad they do not continue to use the 3800's in the mini's because that thing hauled good for a two ton vehicle!  It was fun to drive (gee, I wonder how far in front of me the bumper really is?!?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">)  Having all that cargo room came in really handy too!<P>If all that doesn't change your opinion... look at it this way.  It'll save wear and tear on your Fiero.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Congrats!!||||reg||1
